# Everything the CMS edits. The CMS owns this formatting, and an editor's save
# must never fail CI: a harmless trailing space in a bio (a TinaCMS save to
# leadership/scott-jones.yaml) failed format:check, which stops CI before tests
# and builds run — a failure the editor can neither see nor fix. Content is
# checked where it matters, by the zod schemas and the build scripts. For MDX
# pages Prettier is worse than unnecessary: its reflow breaks block-component
# children (e.g. <Split> wrapping a list).
src/content/
