#
# Nothing catches drift here on its own: the capture job pushes with
# GITHUB_TOKEN, and GitHub does not trigger workflows on those commits, so its
# own output never runs through format:check — a stale path here only surfaces
# on the next human push. Keep this in sync with OUT in capture-events.mjs.
